  "description": "Clancy Quay - Phase 1 Development - Studio.\n\nThis stunning Clancy Quay by Kennedy Wilson apartment in Dublin 8, comes fully furnished with custom-designed interiors and an unbeatable range of on-site management services.\n\nClancy Quay by Kennedy Wilson is delighted to offer you a unique service experience in the rental market to facilitate the renting process and provide you with a wide range of added services and amenities such as maintenance and security services, on site-management office, a state-of-the-art fitness centre free and exclusive to residents, brand new residents' lounge with catering kitchen, games room, business centre with meeting rooms and working stations, beautifully landscaped gardens, and underground parking.\n\n\nClancy Quay: Apartment Features\n\n-\tHigh-quality interior design finish and bespoke furnishings throughout\n-\tProfessionally designed high quality fitted kitchen units with feature granite worktops \n-\tIntegrated dishwasher and washing machine/dryer\n-\tGenerous and bright interiors with large amount of storage space\n-\tThermostatically controlled, efficient central heating system\n-\tWired for phone, cable and broadband services\n-\tDouble-glazed windows\n\nClancy Quay: Local Area & Building\n\n- Located on the historic Clancy Barracks site dating from 1850s\n- Professionally designed and maintained private landscaped courtyards and patios with\nseating areas\n- 3 kms from St Stephen's Green (30-minute walk)\n- 15-minute walk to Heuston Station (Intercity, LUAS and Airlink 747)\n- Extensive Dublin Bus service routes\n- Fast access to the M50 motorway\n- Minutes from the Irish Museum of Modern Art and Phoenix Park\n\n- Audio-visual intercom access system\n- Secure fob control for resident areas\n- Contemporary lighting to all exterior walkways, courtyards and patios\n- Exterior bike cages\n\nServices at Clancy Quay include:\n\n- State-of-the-art gym\n- Cinema room for screenings\n- Business centre with office pods\n- Games room with pool table\n- Chef-style kitchen for events\n- Spacious lounge for relaxing\n- Secure underground parking available at additional cost\n- Views of the Phoenix Park\n- 24-hour monitored CCTV\n- Management office on-site\n- Dedicated property manager\n- After hours management service\n- Mail room/package storage services\n- On-site convenience store\n\nTo truly appreciate the uniqueness of this Kennedy Wilson property, viewing is strongly advised.\nFor more information on this property and other Kennedy Wilson rental properties and services\nplease contact us.\n\n\nPlease note, photographs and VR tour are for illustration purposes only. \n\n\n*** Car Parking Space Not Included *** This Apartment is Not Pet Friendly ***",
